      celebration: `"[child's name] — in an age when AI can generate convincing
content instantly, critical thinking is one of the most valuable skills
a human being can have. You're a Truth Seeker — someone who doesn't
accept information at face value but asks the hard questions that reveal
what's actually real."

[Badge: Truth Seeker]`
